'St James''s',
'Old Money',
'The oldest restaurant in St James''s, established 1742. Wiltons serves oysters, game, and the kind of silence that comes from four generations of the same families eating at the same tables. The room on Jermyn Street has the quality of a private club that accidentally admits non-members if they book far enough in advance. Order the native oysters. Speak quietly. Leave by 9pm.',
